{{Splblocknotes
| name = Shackleshot
| desc = Does not proc [[Spell Block]] sources on secondary affected targets.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Shackleshot icon0}}
| desc = Shackles the target to an enemy unit or tree in a line directly behind it.  If no unit or tree is present, the stun duration is reduced to 0.6.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has a {{#var:Shackleshot basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.

* [[File:Dota2 Windranger Shackleshot Visualization icon-1.png|105px]][[File:Dota2 Windranger Shackleshot Visualization icon-2.png|105px]]
** The area-of-effect is a [[Wikipedia:Isosceles triangle|isosceles triangle]] and has the following properties:
*** Line [[File:Dota2 Letter-f.png|F|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|P|21px]] and line [[File:Dota2 Letter-f.png|F|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-s.png|s|21px]] are the two sides with {{#expr:sqrt((({{#var:Shackleshot value1}}*tan({{#explode:{{#var:Shackleshot value2}}|°}}/2*(pi/180))))^2+{{#var:Shackleshot value1}}^2) round2}}-length.
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|FQ or FS {{=}} √ ( ({{#var:Shackleshot value1}} × tan({{#var:Shackleshot value2}}) / 2 × (π / 180°) )^2 + {{#var:Shackleshot value1}}^2 )}}
*** The third side, line [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|Q|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-s.png|S|21px]] , has a {{#expr:2*({{#var:Shackleshot value1}}*tan({{#explode:{{#var:Shackleshot value2}}|°}}/2*(pi/180))) round2}}-length.
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|QS {{=}} 2 × ({{#var:Shackleshot value1}} × tan({{#var:Shackleshot value2}} / 2 × (π / 180°)))}}

